# A simple asynchronous scoreboard.
# It remembers the game state without a clock.

make a memory named high_score with size 16
make a neuron named player_action with threshold 1 and leak 0

# When the player acts, it writes to the memory
put player_button into the write of high_score

# We can read the memory later to display it
flow the spike from player_action into the read of high_score

start the system
